WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.490
We are celebrating all things design and that includes.

2
00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:08.610
Yes, cause I love design, it makes me happy.

3
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.570
And that includes the history

4
00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.570
behind some of our favorite styles.

5
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.940
I mean, who could forget the geometrical Art Deco

6
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:20.540
of the 20s or the groovy colors and shags of the 70s?

7
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.060
You heard me #shag.

8
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.330
But no style has had more lasting power

9
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.730
than Mid-Century Modern.

10
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:33.220
A look so iconic it never goes out of fashion.

11
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.690
In fact, take a look at the history

12
00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:40.690
of this endlessly chic trend in this design backgrounder.

13
00:00:42.178 --> 00:00:45.470
(bright music)

14
00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:48.060
Mid-Century Modern design began in

15
00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:51.313
you guessed it, the middle of the 20th century.

16
00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.460
The end of World War II created an economic boom

17
00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.670
that allowed more Americans to buy homes.

18
00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:02.600
Progress in physics, chemistry, and even science fiction

19
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:07.460 line:15%
resulted in new materials like plywood, fiberglass, and foam

20
00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.420
used to create innovative designs

21
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.280
with really vibrant colors.

22
00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.760
People wanted to move away from the gloom of the war

23
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.300
and embrace both the naturalism

24
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.040
and experimentation in design.

25
00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.090
The future is now!

26
00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:25.230
As the American dream became more accessible,

27
00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:28.817
architects and designers embraced a populist message,

28
00:01:28.817 --> 00:01:32.471
"Design should be beautiful, functional,

29
00:01:32.471 --> 00:01:34.629
efficient, and attainable."

30
00:01:34.629 --> 00:01:35.462
(upbeat music)

31
00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:39.290
Branching across generations, mid-century modern design

32
00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:40.910
has been seen in our homes

33
00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:43.260
as well as on our television screens.

34
00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.470
From the Brady Bunch to The Jetsons

35
00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:47.940
and to The Incredibles and Madmen,

36
00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.870
we have an enduring image

37
00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:53.450
of how our favorite characters live in this style.

38
00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:55.270
The mid-century modern aesthetic

39
00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:58.920
is characterized by clean lines, simplicity,

40
00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.340
and bright colors.

41
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.310
Pop art and the space age,

42
00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:06.570
both seen as symbols of a modern futuristic era

43
00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:10.440
help define the look of furniture and architecture itself.

44
00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:13.270
And no wonder that mid-century modern design

45
00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:16.110
is still popular in the 21st century.

46
00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.230
The timeless style never seems to lose traction

47
00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:21.910
with many furniture designs more popular now

48
00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.960
than they even were back then in the 50s and 60s.

49
00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:29.010
Fitting seamlessly into our modern day mid-century design

50
00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:31.110
was a prediction of our future

51
00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:35.262
and is now a stylist conversation with our past.

52
00:02:35.262 --> 00:02:37.350
(audience cheers)

53
00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.420
I love that.

54
00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.280
It's such an amazing and rich history

55
00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:43.616
for something so beautiful and so timeless.

56
00:02:43.616 --> 00:02:46.199 line:15%
(upbeat music)

57
00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.793 line:15%
♪ Oh oh oh oh ♪

58
00:02:49.793 --> 00:02:51.728 line:15%
♪ Oh oh oh oh ♪

